<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT-Cemex started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Cemex started as buy.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney has initiated coverage of Mexican cement maker Cemex SA as a buy, the company told Reuters on Friday.</p>
</text>
